{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1090.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"9475ccd94a16889d61b67844c3323e9aec935fbffe015a21e5790edf4920f948","ja":"握手会はもうすぐ終了の時刻。\nけれど、まだファンの列は続いていて……","zh":"握手会眼看就要结束了。\n但是，粉丝的队伍依然没有断绝……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1090.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"b41553fa4426ef1b70303a2adbe6bc491e64af28ef38a2ee0a6b5bc5610a9df7","ja":"全員の方と握手するの、\nちょっとギリギリになりそうね。","zh":"要和所有人握手的话，\n时间好像会有点吃紧呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1090.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"11d08739f36e349c672b802e08ff761d810c393d1fcdb3c1dbcc2568aece4489","ja":"はい。今日は会場の都合で、時間通りに\n終わらないといけないそうですので……。","zh":"好的。听说今天因为场馆方面的安排，\n必须准时结束……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1090.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"7d91d1fe593266e7a49374f5c92783e5dca100fe4c3be21c2ce20dd558597328","ja":"そのとき、またあのお客さんがやってきた","zh":"就在那时，那位客人又来了","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1090.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"114a3998b951c1a0f980e6b5a037e45343655e71101fad012d8fade9a831b80c","ja":"また並んでいただけるなんて……。\nはい、お顔も声もしっかり覚えさせていただきました。","zh":"您居然又来排队了……\n是的，您的面容和声音我都已经牢牢记住了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1090.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"870d929dec5f7e575a631a476056b2200532e530be5f3d48474abf6f1e3ccd6b","ja":"おすすめのご当地スイーツがあるのですか？\nはい、是非お伺いしたいです。あ、ですが……。","zh":"有推荐的当地甜品吗？\n好的，非常乐意听您介绍。啊，但是……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1090.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"63355553a1381d2a3a27df5cb6de52d9bff4a9f5c500aec31e851d7a59d7c957","ja":"お客さんは持ち時間をすぎても\n紬の手を握ったまま、熱心に話し続けて……","zh":"客人即使过了握手时间，\n也依然握着紬的手热切地说着话……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1090.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"ac409dce448562213d8895e729e369e9b2b5f72db600419268464aa523377fc7","ja":"（どうしよう……。注意した方が……。\nでも、ファンの方にそのようなことを言うのは……）","zh":"（该怎么办……是不是提醒一下比较好……\n可是，对粉丝说那种话又……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1090.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"df3bc80e07cf45b1d5a7ba144df4551c5c8716798493b8928549cad0e4757020","ja":"あの、横からごめんね。お店を教えてくれて\nありがとう。今度絶対に行くわ。だから……。","zh":"那个，插嘴抱歉了。谢谢你\n告诉我这家店。下次我一定会去的。所以……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1090.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"cffe5f0d958175a4eb1016c67b69176256a8e80624fb865587573a7afef31cf0","ja":"しかし風花とスタッフの言葉を無視して、\nファンは紬に想いを伝え続けた。そして……","zh":"然而粉丝无视了风花和工作人员的话，\n继续向紬倾诉着自己的心意。接着……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1090.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"56ac8aa939d7ae41a9ceab6c27f7a438decb47d6f921406c8df8f8f14c9db8e5","ja":"次の方もお待ちですので……。はい、応援して\nいただけるのはありがたく……でも、あの……。","zh":"后面的人也在排队等候，所以……。是的，能得到您的\n支持我非常感激……可是，那个……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1090.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"8d1cda90c338f2547247db0b4ceffbd9d17aac87c1fc7ab5748340bf686ef7e1","ja":"い、い、い……。","zh":"你、你、你……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1090.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"415c2decf74361168fe1c617db67f3c3e60d395db0438bc158dd071be60ca28e","ja":"いい加減にしてください！","zh":"请适可而止！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1090.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"0b7ea9d81f1cca3327e1b9af366196f53b5724e10e6e1884e73548219dfaa825","ja":"握手会の時間は限られています。持ち時間を守って\nいただけないと、他の方にご迷惑です。","zh":"握手会的时间是有限的。如果不遵守\n规定时间的话，会给其他人带来困扰。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1090.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"fed0b9027cf2a1417b46f0e1aedca46150d8d6e5eb8b0fc64848aefc1afc46bb","ja":"私は、来ていただいた皆様全員に楽しんで\nいただきたいのです。どうかご理解、お願いします！","zh":"我希望每一位前来的来宾\n都能乐在其中。还请您能够理解！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1090.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"04a4db15ee932147613de9d87f85ef28765046cfb09edb9151a533c3c659aa07","ja":"…………シーン","zh":"…………场景","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1090.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"0ced4c8f2e24d304a5afe8df3b87ee1e6534618c266e029bdc68cb0a78423fab","ja":"つ、紬ちゃん……？","zh":"紬、紬……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1090.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"626f549b861de067c1e4b9a90369a33d1d5a9215d51af7502601b94688f6ba50","ja":"はっ！　え、えっと……その……！","zh":"啊！那、那个……这……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1090.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"eff58090af50b3c3e41ca05818b42694281f318235f9a4ebd6a6c88178525f46","ja":"う、うち……やってしまった……！？","zh":"我、我……搞砸了……！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
